msgstr "If any numeric argument is not finite or is outside its domain (for example, not positive).     If ``c`` exceeds 10⁶."

#: of walopy.advanced.break_even:15 walopy.advanced.break_even_multi:23
#: walopy.advanced.break_even_sales:19 walopy.advanced.erlang_b:17
